; The vault. PersistentId is the save key (inventory:ember_crown.guild_vault) and must never change —
; without one the InventoryComponent does not register as a saveable at all and the vault empties on
; every reload, which looks like an item-loss bug rather than a missing field (37B's rule).
; Capacity is authored on the node, not on the resource: InventoryComponent.Load restores through
; AddInstance, which clamps to Capacity, so a capacity applied later would silently drop the overflow.
